   "source": [
    "# Exercise 4: Factory Pattern for Data Transformations\n",
    "\n",
    "### Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "This exercise introduces the **Factory Pattern**.\n",
    "\n",
    "We will create:\n",
    "\n",
    "- `DataTransform` → abstract parent class\n",
    "- `NormalizeColumns`\n",
    "- `RemoveDuplicates`\n",
    "- `StandardizeText`\n",
    "- `TransformFactory`\n",
    "\n",
    "Instead of manually creating transformation objects, the factory decides which object to create.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "95df4866",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1 — Create the Abstract `DataTransform` Class\n",
    "\n",
    "Every transformation must implement `apply(df)`.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 24,
   "id": "c0ddccc7",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.345930Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.345725Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.350025Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.348363Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "class DataTransform(ABC):\n",
    "\n",
    "    @abstractmethod\n",
    "    def apply(self, df):\n",
    "        pass"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e1d07f59",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2 — Create `NormalizeColumns`\n",
    "\n",
    "This transformation:\n",
    "\n",
    "- removes extra spaces\n",
    "- converts column names to lowercase\n",
    "- replaces spaces with underscores\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 25,
   "id": "335bf722",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.351637Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.351509Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.362672Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.357032Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "class NormalizeColumns(DataTransform):\n",
    "\n",
    "    def apply(self, df):\n",
    "        df = df.copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "        df.columns = (\n",
    "            df.columns\n",
    "            .str.strip()\n",
    "            .str.lower()\n",
    "            .str.replace(\" \", \"_\")\n",
    "        )\n",
    "\n",
    "        return df"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5cdf0ba2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3 — Create `RemoveDuplicates`\n",
    "\n",
    "This transformation removes duplicate rows.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 26,
   "id": "c4c04f37",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.365750Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.365624Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.372169Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.370147Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "class RemoveDuplicates(DataTransform):\n",
    "\n",
    "    def apply(self, df):\n",
    "        return df.drop_duplicates()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0f06cc80",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4 — Create `StandardizeText`\n",
    "\n",
    "This transformation:\n",
    "\n",
    "- removes extra spaces from text values\n",
    "- converts text to lowercase\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 27,
   "id": "bccc019d",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.376725Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.376580Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.385956Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.381605Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "class StandardizeText(DataTransform):\n",
    "\n",
    "    def apply(self, df):\n",
    "        df = df.copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "        text_columns = df.select_dtypes(include=\"object\").columns\n",
    "\n",
    "        for column in text_columns:\n",
    "            df[column] = df[column].str.strip().str.lower()\n",
    "\n",
    "        return df"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "90eea5be",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5 — Create `TransformFactory`\n",
    "\n",
    "The factory receives a string and returns the correct transformation object.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 28,
   "id": "b7e27ed4",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.389680Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.389560Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.396007Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-22T14:29:59.395231Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "class TransformFactory:\n",
    "\n",
    "    @staticmethod\n",
    "    def create_transform(transform_type):\n",
    "\n",
    "        if transform_type == \"normalize\":\n",
    "            return NormalizeColumns()\n",
    "\n",
    "        elif transform_type == \"duplicates\":\n",
    "            return RemoveDuplicates()\n",
    "\n",
    "        elif transform_type == \"text\":\n",
    "            return StandardizeText()\n",
    "\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            raise ValueError(f\"Unknown transformation: {transform_type}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0ce92e18",
   "metadata": {},
